WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.362
To close, here's what each gate
leaves in Git, and what comes next.

2
00:00:04.362 --> 00:00:09.112
Gate 0 leaves the Start Kit run, the
group decisions and the unit map.

3
00:00:09.112 --> 00:00:14.163
Gate 1 leaves the signed slot register,
which every rule and persona will read.

4
00:00:14.163 --> 00:00:17.686
Gate 2 leaves the validation
run folder, the threshold,

5
00:00:17.686 --> 00:00:20.662
the owned exceptions,
and the removed writers.

6
00:00:20.662 --> 00:00:24.788
Gate 3 leaves the sample check's
result, the reconciliation report,

7
00:00:24.788 --> 00:00:27.638
and live pilot data for
the shadow comparison.

8
00:00:27.638 --> 00:00:30.437
The attributes are now true and flowing.

9
00:00:30.437 --> 00:00:35.690
Part 2 takes Gates 4 to 6: the dynamic
group library and administrative units,

10
00:00:35.690 --> 00:00:41.026
the Conditional Access personas and
targeting conventions, and P I V binding.

11
00:00:41.026 --> 00:00:43.837
Those are the mechanisms
that read the attributes.

12
00:00:43.837 --> 00:00:44.660
Thank you.
